3 /x/Q/z.tar.gz | _x_y_z.tar.gz | ROOT/y/z.tar.gz | /x/y/z.tar.bz2
4 quoted var is literal: a*b | unquoted var is a pattern: a*b
5 escaped glob in pattern: b | quoted glob: b | live glob: *b
6 backslashes: a/b/c | a-b-c
7 replacement escapes: aa\ | $$b | $x$xb
8 command subst in pattern: /y/z.tar.gz | arith: /y/z.tar.gz
